        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim Rice; Leslie Marmon Silko; Kenneth Lincoln\n- Roles: author; lyricist; writer; literary critic\n- Awards: Academy Award; Golden Globe Award; Tony Award; Grammy Award\n- Concepts: Native American Renaissance; First Wave\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Rice was born on 10 November 1944.\n- Tim Rice is an English author and lyricist.\n- Tim Rice has won Academy, Golden Globe, Tony, and Grammy Awards.\n- Leslie Marmon Silko was born as Leslie Marmon on March 5, 1948.\n- Leslie Marmon Silko is a Laguna Pueblo writer.\n- Leslie Marmon Silko is one of the key figures in the First Wave of the Native American Renaissance.\n- Kenneth Lincoln is a literary critic who called that movement the Native American Renaissance.",
